(In the modern world, hospitals use computers to save patient information. This is called an) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 708.6616535433070112 Td
(Electronic Health Record, or EHR. However, there is a big problem. Sometimes, one computer) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 688.819133858267719 Td
(system cannot understand the data from another system. This is like two people speaking different) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 668.9766141732283131 Td
(languages. To fix this, we need a standard. One very important standard is called openEHR. The) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 649.1340944881889072 Td
(most important part of openEHR is the 'archetype'.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 609.4490551181102092 Td
(What is an Archetype?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 569.7640157480313974 Td
(Imagine you have a box of Lego blocks. Each block has a specific shape and size. You can use) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 549.9214960629921052 Td
(these blocks to build a house, a car, or a boat. In openEHR, an archetype is like a single Lego) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 530.0789763779526993 Td
(block. It is a model for one specific piece of clinical information. For example, there is an archetype) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 510.2364566929133503 Td
(for 'Blood Pressure'. There is another archetype for 'Body Temperature'. ) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 470.5514173228345953 Td
(An archetype tells the computer exactly what the information looks like. For 'Blood Pressure', the) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 450.7088976377952463 Td
(archetype says, 'We need two numbers: Systolic and Diastolic'. It also says, 'The unit is millimeters) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 430.8663779527558404 Td
(of mercury \(mmHg\)'. Because of this archetype, every computer knows exactly what 'Blood) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 411.0238582677164914 Td
(Pressure' means. They all agree on the pattern.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 371.3388188976377364 Td
(The Structure of Archetypes) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 331.6537795275589815 Td
(Archetypes are very organized. They are not just random notes. They have a specific structure. ) Tj
