BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 626.4569291338582389 Td
(They need to check weight, temperature, and ask questions. To do this, we put many archetypes) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 606.614409448818833 Td
(together. This group is called a 'Template'. A template is like a full form that the doctor fills out. It) Tj
