/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 547.086850393700729 Td
(Why use Archetypes?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 507.4018110236219741 Td
(Using archetypes is very helpful. First, it helps computers share data. Second, archetypes can be) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 487.559291338582625 Td
(translated. The computer code stays the same, but the words can change from English to Spanish) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 467.716771653543276 Td
(or French. This means doctors all over the world can use the same models. openEHR archetypes) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. g
56.6929133858267775 447.8742519685038701 Td
(make medical data safe, clear, and easy to understand.) Tj
