/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 507.4018110236219741 Td
(Exactly. In the past, every hospital used a different way to write these notes. One hospital) Tj
T* (might write 'BP' for blood pressure. Another might write 'Blood Press'. A computer cannot) Tj
T* (understand that 'BP' and 'Blood Press' are the same thing.) Tj
