ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 428.0317322834645211 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 428.0317322834645211 Td
(Yes. So, openEHR provides a standard. It gives us a set of rules so all computers) Tj
T* (understand the data. The most important tool for this is the 'archetype'.) Tj
