/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 388.3466929133857661 Td
(Okay, so what is an archetype exactly? Is it a computer program?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 362.8348818897637216 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 362.8348818897637216 Td
(Not exactly. Think of it as a model or a pattern. Do you like Lego blocks?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 337.323070866141677 Td
(Joe:) Tj
