(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 311.8112598425195756 Td
(Great. Imagine that clinical data is like a building. An archetype is like a specific type of) Tj
T* (Lego block. One archetype defines one specific concept. For example, there is an) Tj
T* (archetype for 'Blood Pressure'.) Tj
