/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 232.4411811023621794 Td
(Inside the archetype, there is a definition. It tells us what data we need. For blood) Tj
T* (pressure, we need two numbers. Do you know what they are?) Tj
ET
