/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 759.6852755905511003 Td
(Yes, it has rules. In openEHR, we call these 'constraints'. A constraint is a limit.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 734.1734645669291695 Td
