(What kind of limit?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 708.6616535433070112 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 708.6616535433070112 Td
(Well, think about body temperature. Can a human have a body temperature of 1000) Tj
T* (degrees?) Tj
