/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 643.4648031496062686 Td
(Exactly. So, the archetype has a constraint. It might say, 'Temperature must be between) Tj
T* (20 degrees and 45 degrees'. If a doctor types 1000, the computer will say 'Error! This is) Tj
T* (wrong'.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 589.6065354330708033 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 589.6065354330708033 Td
(That is very smart. It stops mistakes.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 564.0947244094487587 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 564.0947244094487587 Td
(Yes. Now, you need to know that there are different classes of archetypes. Not all medical) Tj
T* (data is the same.) Tj
