/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 524.4096850393700606 Td
(What do you mean by classes?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 498.8978740157479592 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 498.8978740157479592 Td
(We group them by what they do. The first class is called 'Observation'. This is the most) Tj
T* (common one.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
