/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 459.2128346456692611 Td
(Observation... that means looking at something, right?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 433.7010236220471597 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 433.7010236220471597 Td
(Yes. It is information that you can measure or see. Blood pressure, weight, height, and) Tj
T* (heart rate are all Observations. You observe the patient to get the number.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 394.0159842519684616 Td
(Joe:) Tj
