/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 368.5041732283464171 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 368.5041732283464171 Td
(The next one is 'Evaluation'. This is different. An evaluation is not just a number. It is an) Tj
T* (opinion or a decision made by the doctor.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 328.8191338582676053 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 328.8191338582676053 Td
(Can you give me an example?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 303.3073228346455608 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 303.3073228346455608 Td
(Sure. A diagnosis is an evaluation. If the doctor looks at your symptoms and says, 'You) Tj
T* (have the flu', that is an Evaluation. It comes from the doctor's brain, not just a machine.) Tj
