BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 238.1104724409448181 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 238.1104724409448181 Td
