T* (tells someone to do something.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 198.4254330708660063 Td
(Joe:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 198.4254330708660063 Td
(Like giving a prescription?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
