/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 578.2679527559055259 Td
(Yes, exactly. Imagine a form for a 'Yearly Checkup'. This template will include the Blood) Tj
T* (Pressure archetype, the Weight archetype, and the Height archetype. It groups them) Tj
T* (together for a specific purpose.) Tj
