11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 524.4096850393700606 Td
(Can we change the archetypes when we put them in a template?) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 498.8978740157479592 Td
(Jane:) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0. g
127.5590551181102512 498.8978740157479592 Td
(We cannot change the definition, but we can make it more specific. For example, an) Tj
T* (archetype might have a list of 100 possible symptoms. But for a 'Flu Check' template, we) Tj
T* (might only show the 5 symptoms related to the flu.) Tj
ET
