127.5590551181102512 354.3309448818897067 Td
(The computer code—the structure—is the same everywhere. But the labels can be) Tj
T* (translated. So, a doctor in Spain sees 'Presión arterial', and a doctor in the UK sees 'Blood) Tj
T* (Pressure'. But the computer knows it is the exact same archetype.) Tj
